  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Finely chop brown onion. Rinse and drain lentils.\n• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion and carrot & zucchini mix, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add mild curry paste, the butter and garlic paste and cook, stirring, until softened, 3 minutes",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652e0d81d5d953d2ad4b76b5-ae4321ce.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in coconut milk, vegetable stock pot and the water. Bring to the boil then reduce heat to medium. Stir well to combine. Simmer until slightly thickened, 6-8 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652e0d81d5d953d2ad4b76b5-2d6691e6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice mini flourtortillas into 3cm strips.\n• Place tortilla strips on a lined oven tray in a single layer. Drizzle or brush with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes. TIP: Use two oven trays if your tortilla strips don’t fit in a single layer",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652e0d81d5d953d2ad4b76b5-06878712.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the saucepan, add lentils and baby spinach leaves. Stir to combine and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes. Remove from heat and season to taste.\n• Divide the Indian-style veggie coconut soup between bowls. Top with Greek-style yoghurt and tear over mint leaves.\n• Serve with tortilla dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652e0d81d5d953d2ad4b76b5-ba3a5478.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
